{"type": "message", "id": "cdf5e4e9", "parentId": "e57cc217", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T11:17:18.955Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_2319edd427af4ae39de1666d", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"railway suicides\\\" Germany 2014 2020 number decrease percentage Eurostat ERA data\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 860,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"871137065598fafe\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBehavioral and location‐related antecedents of train suicides - Moritz - 2023 - Suicide and Life-Threatening Behavior - Wiley Online Library\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"871137065598fafe\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/sltb.12941\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95a5be7602d617ec\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAbstract Background In the European Union, <strong>over 2000 suicides on railway premises were reported in 2020.</strong> Identifying individuals&#x27; behavioral and location patterns just before they die or attempt to...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95a5be7602d617ec\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 30, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"onlinelibrary.wiley.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8184e2097540459d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nStable time patterns of railway suicides in Germany: comparative analysis of 7,187 cases across two observation periods (1995–1998; 2005–2008) - PMC\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8184e2097540459d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3933256/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ac7b90091d994d43\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe majority of fatalities on the European Union (EU) railways are suicides, representing about <strong>60% of all railway fatalities</strong>. The aim of this study was to compare time patterns of suicidal behaviour on railway tracks in Germany between two ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ac7b90091d994d43\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e6cce38c26400b8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTen-year incidence and time trends of railway suicides in Germany from 1991 to 2000 | European Journal of Public Health | Oxford Academic\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2e6cce38c26400b8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://academic.oup.com/eurpub/article/16/2/173/505730\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8b4061cf3a1d856f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe first railway suicide ever officially recorded was a male subject in the year 1852 about 22 years after the beginning of the railway era.1 Since then, corresponding with the build-up of the railway system worldwide, a steady increase in the number of railway suicides have been registered, accounting for a serious mortality issue.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8b4061cf3a1d856f\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 1, 2006\",\n      \"siteName\": \"academic.oup.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"63be149566973aa8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nUQAM | CRISE | Railway suicides | Railway fatalities\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"63be149566973aa8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://railwaysuicideprevention.com/scientific-literature-review/choose/railway-fatalities.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"470286944a4754be\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nUnfortunately, different countries and transportation systems keep different forms of records and use different criteria to determine the number of suicides and “suspected suicides.” Reynders, Scheerder and Van Audenhove (2010) compared data on railway suicides in 15 European countries in the European Railway Agency (ERA) reports with data from the official government statistics as indicated in the European Detailed Mortality Database.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"470286944a4754be\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"railwaysuicideprevention.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"814c27d3ee6a342c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAbsolute numbers and rates (per 100 000 inhabitants) of railway... | Download Table\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"814c27d3ee6a342c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://researchgate.net/figure/Absolute-numbers-and-rates-per-100-000-inhabitants-of-railway-suicides-and-all-suicides_tbl1_7667676\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f5941c8f99832673\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nDownload Table | Absolute numbers ... incidence and time trends of railway suicides in Germany from 1991 to 2000 | <strong>Railway suicides strongly</strong> ......\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f5941c8f99832673\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"researchgate.net\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"57022b0b916d244b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCelebrity suicide on the railway network: Can one case trigger international effects? - ScienceDirect\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"57022b0b916d244b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0165032715004036\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"165972541d97524b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOverall, <strong>an upwards trend of railway suicide numbers was registered from 2006 (1878 cases) until 2012 (2997 cases)</strong> (ERA, 2014, data for the member states 